# Implementation Plan: Push Notifications & Driver App

Here is the plan to implement the requested features:

## 1. Push Notifications (ETA Alerts) 🔔
Instead of setting up a complex backend VAPID/FCM infrastructure for the MVP, we will leverage the browser's native `Notification` API directly in the frontend during an active tracking session.

### Proposed Changes
- Request Notification permissions from the user when they start tracking a bus.
- In `LiveMap.tsx` or the tracking state, monitor the `etaMinutes` of the user's target stop (or the upcoming stop).
- When the ETA drops to exactly 10 minutes or 5 minutes, trigger a native OS Push Notification: *"Your bus UP32XX is arriving in X mins"*.
- We will track which notifications have been sent (e.g., `notified5Min = true`) to prevent spamming.

