## 2. Private Buses Tracking (Driver App) 🚌
We will create a dedicated interface for drivers to broadcast their location.

### Proposed Changes
- **Frontend**: Create a new page `/driver` in the web app. It will have a simple form taking `Registration Number` and `Route Code`.
- When the driver clicks "Start Trip", we will use `navigator.geolocation.watchPosition()` to stream high-accuracy GPS data.
- **Backend API**: Create a new REST endpoint `/api/v1/driver/location` that accepts `busRegNo`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `speed`, and `heading`.
- **Database**: The backend will upsert this data into the `bus_live_state` table.
- **Integration**: Because our Engine already processes `bus_live_state` for UPSRTC buses, the private bus will *automatically* appear on the live maps, get ETAs, and trigger the AI Route Seeder!

